25	 * a third {@code PENDING} constant on {@link Verdict}, which is the shape design decision
26	 * 8 sketched — would make "nobody has answered" one of the answers, and every reader would
27	 * then have to know which of the three is not really a Verdict. {@link
28	 * hu.bankmonitor.payments.transfers.TransferStatus} carries {@code PENDING} for the
29	 * opposite reason: a Transfer really is in that state. Nothing is in the state of having
30	 * given the null answer.
31	 *
32	 * <p><b>The Transfer is referenced by ID, not by association</b>, on {@code Transfer}'s own
33	 * precedent: a Transfer only ever leaves {@code PENDING} by a conditional update guarded on
34	 * the status it is leaving, and an association would offer a second way to reach one that
35	 * quietly skips that.
36	 *
